0.7,8630.2,9146.3,9635.0,10093.3,10519.1,10910.8,11267.7,11589.3,11875.8,12127.7,12345.7,12530.8,12684.3,12807.4,12901.4,12968.0,13008.6,13024.7,13017.9,12989.7,12941.4,13414.3,13954.9,14498.7,15045.5,15595.2,16147.4,16702.2,17259.4,17818.8,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4]},"events":[{"id":"distillation-wave","year":2026.7,"layer":"security","text":"Distillation attacks on frontier APIs become the cheap path to parity; providers deploy detection and rate-hardening.","cites":["sources/anthropic-2028-ai-leadership"]},{"id":"bubble-correction","year":2026.9,"layer":"economy","text":"The AI capex complex corrects sharply; valuations reset while physical build-out survives.","cites":["analysis/ai-bubble-vs-buildout","concepts/ai-bubble-debate"]},{"id":"sc-crossing","year":2028.6,"layer":"capability","text":"Frontier systems cross the superhuman-coder line; AI-run engineering teams become the norm at leading labs.","cites":["sources/ai-2027","concepts/agi-timelines"]},{"id":"agent-incident","year":2028.7,"layer":"safety","text":"A deployed agent causes a headline incident with real-world damage; incident-investigation authority lands on the agenda.","cites":["concepts/ai-backlash","analysis/interpretability-and-safety"]},{"id":"copyright-settles","year":2029.1,"layer":"law","text":"The copyright question reaches doctrine: appellate rulings settle training-data liability into a licensing regime.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","litigation/nyt-v-openai"]},{"id":"preemption-fight","year":2029.7,"layer":"law","text":"The federal-preemption fight over the state AI-law patchwork comes to a head in Congress and the courts.","cites":["analysis/eu-vs-us-ai-regulation"]},{"id":"eu-decision-point","year":2030.9,"layer":"geopolitics","text":"Europe faces its leverage moment over lithography and market access; the choice made in 2030 sets its decade.","cites":["sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"labor-constitution","year":2033.5,"layer":"labor","text":"Work's social contract is renegotiated: wage insurance, flexicurity variants, and the first serious dividend schemes.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption","sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"bio-century","year":2046.4,"layer":"science","text":"The compressed century in biology arrives: AI-driven cures clear major disease families decades ahead of prior trendlines.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]},{"id":"governance-of-plenty","year":2055.8,"layer":"far","text":"The central political question becomes allocation among abundant options rather than scarcity management.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace","sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]},{"id":"digital-minds","year":2067.5,"layer":"far","text":"Digital persons hold legal standing in several jurisdictions; population statistics grow a second column.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"layers":{"economy":[{"year":2029,"text":"Stalled build-out: stranded capex, cheap second-hand compute, innovation continuing on efficiency rather than scale.","cites":["concepts/ai-bubble-debate"]},{"year":2044,"text":"Whatever the 2020s broke or built, mid-century output is dominated by AI-run production; the argument is allocation.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"labor":[{"year":2029,"text":"Split labor market: augmented professions pull ahead, exposed ones hollow; geography and sector decide who feels which future.","cites":["concepts/ai-displacement-vs-augmentation"]},{"year":2049,"text":"Work as identity loosens: dividend schemes, contribution economies, and the post-work constitution debates.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption"]}],"law":[{"year":2029,"text":"Patchwork doctrine: state laws multiply, preemption contested, copyright settled into licensing, liability migrating from disclosure to outcomes.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","analysis/eu-vs-us-ai-regulation"]},{"year":2044,"text":"Personhood at the bar: digital minds, AI counsel, and liability for autonomous systems define the mid-century docket.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"geopolitics":[{"year":2029,"text":"The race entrenches: compute blocs, chip chokepoints, Taiwan premium; every summit is about AI even when it isn't.","cites":["analysis/us-china-ai-competition"]},{"year":2049,"text":"Power follows compute and its energy; the map of capability is the map of leverage.","cites":["concepts/compute-governance"]}],"public":[{"year":2029,"text":"Fracture: pro- and anti-AI identities cut across parties; the Europe-2031 pattern of publics splitting within countries.","cites":["sources/europe-2031"]},{"year":2049,"text":"A generation raised with minds-on-tap; the meaning politics the far field keeps on the table.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]}],"science":[{"year":2034,"text":"The compressed century opens: AI-driven biology clears disease families ahead of trend; materials and climate tech follow.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]},{"year":2059,"text":"The frontier is nonhuman: discovery outpaces comprehension, and translation becomes its own discipline.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"climate":[{"year":2041,"text":"The payback test: AI-designed energy tech (fusion bets, grid optimization, materials) begins repaying the build-out's carbon debt.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace","industries/energy"]},{"year":2059,"text":"Climate outcomes track governance more than compute: the decisive variable was always deployment speed of what the science found.","cites":["industries/energy"]}]}}